    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:459
    old "Official hall monitor and personal aide to Principal [saga.cast.ursula.clan], [saga.cast.annie] is a brown nose extraordinaire with a penchant for rubbing her fellow students the wrong way. Straight A student, President (and only member) of the school disciplinary committee, budding author, and occasional accountant for her parents.\n\nNo one is quite sure why [saga.cast.annie] is so dedicated to Principal [saga.cast.ursula.clan] or what joy she could possibly derive from being such an unbearable stickler and enforcing the rules upon her peers.\n\nHer newest book, 'Proper School Etiquette and Attire' has currently sold two copies online."
    new "身为学校的纪律监督员兼[saga.cast.ursula.clan]校长的私人助手，[saga.cast.annie]拍马屁的本领堪称一绝，还总爱惹同学讨厌。她成绩全优，是校纪委员会的主席兼唯一成员，也是初出茅庐的作家，偶尔还替父母记账。\n\n没人明白[saga.cast.annie]为什么对[saga.cast.ursula.clan]校长如此忠心，也不知道她成天死抠规矩、逼同学遵守校规，到底能从中得到什么乐趣。\n\n她的新书《校园礼仪与着装规范》目前已在网上售出两本。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:485
    old "One of the most popular girls in school, you know little about her. She's unmistakably beautiful with a perfect frame and luscious red hair.\n\nShe's constantly surrounded by her friends and quick to rebuff any attempts to approach her, it's probably best to just keep your distance.\n\nIf you can resist her cute freckles, round face, and button nose."
    new "她是学校里最受欢迎的女孩之一，不过你对她了解不多。她确实漂亮，身材完美，还有一头迷人的红发。\n\n她身边总围着朋友，谁想接近都会很快碰一鼻子灰。最好还是跟她保持距离。\n\n前提是，你能抵挡住她可爱的雀斑、圆圆的脸蛋和小巧的鼻子。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:496
    old "Calling Summerville College's athletics director a hardliner would be somewhat understating it. In the span of a year, she has not only massively improved the overall well-being of the student body but also taken over coaching responsibilities for the championship cheer squad and notoriously pathetic basketball team.\n\nHer origins prior to joining the faculty remain shrouded in mystery but one thing is certain: this woman is a hurricane!"
