    new "在那对拉丁裔搭档中，[saga.cast.camila]嗓门更大，也更不好惹。她总跟管事的人起冲突，仿佛非得把身边的人惹毛才甘心。真要说有谁能跟她合得来，大概也只有她最好的朋友[saga.cast.val]。\n\n反正，这两人几乎走到哪儿都黏在一起。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:526
    old "This hulking ignoramus is the star power forward of the infamously underwhelming Summerville Sharks. When he's not parked under the hoop, gobbling up rebounds, he can often be found bullying the less fortunate in the school hallways.\n\nHe's been held back several times and it's rumored he's borderline illiterate but speaking such in his presence is a surefire way of getting served a knuckle sandwich.\n\nHe's quite adept at giving out swirlies, as your best friend [saga.cast.erik] can attest."
    new "这个人高马大、没什么脑子的家伙，是那支弱得出了名的夏日镇鲨鱼队的明星大前锋。不在篮下抢篮板时，常能在学校走廊里看到他欺负弱小。\n\n他留过好几次级，据说几乎不识字，不过当着他的面这么说，肯定会挨上一拳。\n\n他特别擅长把人的头按进马桶里冲水，你最好的朋友[saga.cast.erik]就能作证。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:553
    old "[saga.cast.anon]'s lifelong friend and neighbor. His resourcefulness, quick thinking, unwavering loyalty, and eagerness to play second fiddle make him the ideal companion to any would-be hero. He's an avid gamer, amateur professional LARPer, tabletop savant, hobbyist bird watcher, wooer of virtual maidens, and currently holds the most DKP in guild history.\n\nProbably not the wingman you needed, but most assuredly the one you deserve."
    new "[saga.cast.anon]从小一起长大的好友兼邻居。他点子多、反应快、够义气，还心甘情愿当配角，简直是每个准英雄梦寐以求的搭档。他是狂热游戏迷、业余的“职业”实景角色扮演玩家、桌游高手、观鸟爱好者，还热衷于追求虚拟少女，至今保持着公会有史以来最高的DKP纪录。\n\n也许不是你想要的僚机，却绝对是与你绝配的那一个。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:585
    old "This upbeat little redhead works inside the mall at an adult sex and romance shop called PINK. An expert in \"sexual accessories,\" [saga.cast.ivy]'s work ethic and drive to please has endeared her with many of her fellow mall dwellers.\n\nRumour has it, she runs a little side business out of the back but only for those who are in the know."
    new "这个开朗的红发姑娘在商场的成人情趣用品店“粉色诱惑”工作。[saga.cast.ivy]是“情趣配件”的行家，工作勤快，又总想让顾客满意，因此很受商场里其他人的喜爱。\n\n据说她还在店后做点副业，不过只招待懂门道的人。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:594
    old "Local librarian and romance novel enthusiast, [saga.cast.jane] is an extremely well-read and intelligent individual.\n\nWhich begs the question, \"Why on earth is she best friends with your roommate [saga.cast.jenny]?\""
    new "本地图书管理员兼言情小说爱好者[saga.cast.jane]博览群书，聪明过人。\n\n这就让人不禁想问：“她到底为什么会跟你的室友[saga.cast.jenny]成为最好的朋友？”"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:601
    old "Daughter of [saga.cast.debbie] and unwilling housemate of [saga.cast.anon]. She was extremely close with [saga.cast.frank] [saga.cast.frank.clan], who loved and spoiled her as if she were his own. Recent college dropout, former prom queen, national cheer champion, and self-proclaimed princess.  She's grown quite used to getting her way over the years and doesn't take rejection well, like at all.\n\nPut bluntly, [saga.cast.jenny] is an arrogant pain in the ass with a notoriously short temper and massive superiority complex."
    new "[saga.cast.debbie]的女儿，对与[saga.cast.anon]同住这件事百般不情愿。她曾与[saga.cast.frank] [saga.cast.frank.clan]十分亲近，他也把她当亲生女儿一样疼爱、娇惯。她刚从大学辍学，当过毕业舞会皇后，拿过全国啦啦队冠军，还自封为公主。这些年事事顺心惯了，最受不了的就是别人对她说“不”——半点都不行。\n\n说白了，[saga.cast.jenny]就是个傲慢难缠的麻烦精，脾气臭得出了名，还总觉得自己高人一等。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:613
    old "Wrench jockey at the local car dealership.\n\nBelieves himself to be quite smooth with the ladies, but you haven't seen any proof of that."
    new "本地车行的修车师傅。\n\n自认为很会讨女人欢心，不过你还没见识过他的本事。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:619
    old "Junior Sales Associate at the local car dealership. A self-described memelord and internet junkie, [saga.cast.josie] doesn't seem interested in the world outside her cellphone.\n\nFormerly a cashier at a low end clothing store, she now finds herself under the ever watchful eye of her father, [saga.cast.yoshi.name]."
    new "本地车行的初级销售员。[saga.cast.josie]自称玩梗大神兼网瘾患者，对手机以外的世界似乎毫无兴趣。\n\n她以前在一家低档服装店当收银员，如今却得时时待在父亲[saga.cast.yoshi.name]的眼皮底下。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:638
    old "Young proprietress of Cupid and local fashion expert, [saga.cast.kassy] has built herself up as a pillar of the Summerville Mall.\n\nWhen she isn't working, she can often be found hanging out with her best friend and roommate [saga.cast.lily] or frequenting the local Cinema with their pal [saga.cast.zana].\n\nShe's also quite interested in some of the more mysterious happenings around town."
    new "丘比特的年轻女店主兼本地时尚达人[saga.cast.kassy]，已经成了山畔商场的中流砥柱。\n\n不上班时，她常与最好的朋友兼室友[saga.cast.lily]一起玩，或跟她们的好友[saga.cast.zana]去本地电影院。\n\n镇上发生的那些神秘事件，她也很感兴趣。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:650
    old "The resident 'dudebro' of your social circle, [saga.cast.kevin] comes off as the prototypical man's man. He is a huge proponent of competitive sports and seems especially interested in organizations/events that foster male camaraderie.\n\nHe's undeniably good looking and is constantly being pursued by a bevy of female admirers, though oddly, he seems to view this as more of an annoyance than anything else. Always quick to offer support to any 'bro' in need, especially in the gym.\n\nCheck out those glutes!"
    new "[saga.cast.kevin]是你朋友圈里典型的“兄弟至上”派，浑身都透着男子汉气概。他热爱竞技体育，尤其喜欢能增进男人之间情谊的组织和活动。\n\n他确实长得帅，追求他的女人络绎不绝，可奇怪的是，他似乎只觉得烦。哪个“兄弟”需要帮忙，他总会立刻伸出援手，尤其是在健身房里。\n\n看看那臀肌！"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:663
    old "[saga.cast.tony]'s faithful wife and proprietress of the best damn pizza shop in town. Renowned for her cooking skills and sassy attitude.\n\n[saga.cast.maria] is a passionate woman and old-fashioned. She places a very high value on dependability and strong work ethic."
    new "[saga.cast.tony]忠贞的妻子，也是镇上最棒的披萨店的女主人。她以精湛厨艺和泼辣性格闻名。\n\n[saga.cast.maria]热情奔放，观念却很传统。她非常看重一个人是否可靠，工作是否勤恳。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:671
    old "Contagiously optimistic and endlessly cheerful, Miss [saga.cast.melody.clan] is a beacon of light within Summerville College. Inspiring her students through song and dance, and promoting a sense of community through teamwork. Her beautiful voice and curvaceous form bedazzle the senses and stupefy onlookers with an astounding regularity.\n\nShe can often be found jamming out in her office after class."
    new "[saga.cast.melody.clan]小姐总是乐呵呵的，乐观得能感染身边每个人，像夏日学院里的一缕阳光。她用歌舞鼓励学生，让大家在合作中学会团结。那副好嗓子，再加上凹凸有致的身段，时不时就能把旁人迷得魂都没了。\n\n课后去她办公室，常能碰上她正忘情地玩着音乐。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:681
    old "The adorable next-door neighbor girl, [saga.cast.mia] has been a friendly presence in [saga.cast.anon]'s life since his first day of pre-school. However, due to her strict upbringing, he has thus far been unable to form a closer bond with her. Outwardly cheerful, deliciously innocent, abundantly polite, and cute as a button. Her beautiful smile is often all it takes to melt one's heart, bewitch the mind and ensnare the senses.\n\nHer bedroom window is conveniently positioned within easy eyesight."
    new "可爱的邻家女孩[saga.cast.mia]，从[saga.cast.anon]第一天上幼儿园起就陪伴在他身边。不过，她家教太严，两人的关系至今没能再近一步。她看着开朗，纯真得让人心动，待人礼貌，怎么看怎么可爱。只要甜甜一笑，就能把人心都化了，让人神魂颠倒。\n\n巧得很，她卧室的窗户一眼就能望见。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:692
    old "One of the most popular girls in school, you've known her forever. She used to be quite friendly when you were younger but since high school started, she's distanced herself from everyone outside of the popular clique.\n\nA bit of an airhead. Her thin, tall frame and long legs lend her a unique and undeniable appeal."
    new "她是学校里最受欢迎的女孩之一，你们认识很久了。小时候她还挺友善，可上高中以后，她就跟小圈子以外的人都疏远了。\n\n她有点没心没肺。高挑纤细的身材和修长双腿，让她有种独特而无法否认的魅力。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:701
    old "Pride of the school track team and local swim champion, [saga.cast.rhonda] certainly appears to have a bright future ahead of her. She is strong willed and diligent with her training, though she can come off a little robotic at times. You have to respect her drive and anyone with eyes could see she's stunning... It's just, you don't see how her strict schedule could possibly leave any room for fun.\n\nMaybe you're missing something?"
    new "身为校田径队的骄傲和本地游泳冠军，[saga.cast.rhonda]显然前途光明。她意志坚定，训练勤奋，不过有时显得有点机械。她那股拼劲值得敬佩，谁都看得出她很漂亮……只是你实在想不明白，这么严格的日程还能怎么找乐子。\n\n也许你漏看了什么？"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:712
    old "Head cheerleader, renowned beach babe, and sovereign of the popular table—[saga.cast.roxxy] epitomizes the term 'Queen Bitch'. Consistently surrounded by her entourage and notoriously quick to anger, her wrath is feared school wide.\n\nShe's made her dislike for you well-known and the most sensible path would be to just avoid her. However, there's something in her eyes that hints at hidden depths buried somewhere beneath her shallow, bitchy, exterior.\n\nYou can't help but be a little intrigued."
    new "啦啦队长、有名的沙滩美女、风云人物餐桌的女王——[saga.cast.roxxy]把“女王贱人”这个词诠释得淋漓尽致。她身边总围着一群跟班，脾气暴躁得出了名，整个学校都怕她发火。\n\n她早就公开表示讨厌你，最明智的做法就是躲远点。不过，她的眼神似乎暗示着，在那浅薄刻薄的表象之下，还藏着不为人知的一面。\n\n你不由得有点好奇。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:735
    old "Manager of the Summerville bank, [saga.cast.tina] is an elegant woman with a shapely figure and beautiful red hair.\n\nNewly widowed, she yearns for the comfort and prosperity she used to enjoy in her former life."
    new "夏日镇银行经理[saga.cast.tina]是个优雅的女人，身材曼妙，红发迷人。\n\n她刚失去丈夫，渴望重新找回昔日舒适富足的生活。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:742
    old "Owner of the best damn pizza joint in town, [saga.cast.tony] is a jovial man with a huge heart.\n\nHe and his wife, [saga.cast.maria], settled in Summerville after fleeing their former life in Brooklyn after a profound tragedy robbed him of his lifelong friend and blood brother, Luigi.\n\nHe would do anything for his family."
    new "镇上最棒的披萨店老板[saga.cast.tony]性格开朗，心地宽厚。\n\n一场惨痛的悲剧夺走了他一生的挚友、亲如手足的Luigi，之后他和妻子[saga.cast.maria]离开布鲁克林，来到夏日镇定居。\n\n为了家人，他什么都愿意做。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:753
    old "The polite word to describe Miss [saga.cast.tori.clan] is \"eccentric\" but a more apt term might be batshit insane. This intellectual powerhouse is highly opinionated, erratic, quirky, and more than a little selfish. Endlessly inventive, her disregard for the well-being of those around her resulted in a blacklisting from nearly all major scientific institutions.\n\nMost students give her a wide berth but given your low science grade, that won't be an option for you."
    new "说得客气点，[saga.cast.tori.clan]小姐是“古怪”；说得直白点，她简直疯得没边。这位天才主意大、性情怪，想一出是一出，还颇为自私。她的发明点子层出不穷，却从不在乎会不会害到身边的人，结果几乎上了所有大科研机构的黑名单。\n\n大多数学生都躲她远远的。可就凭你那点科学成绩，想躲也躲不了。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:764
    old "As principal of the school, she rules with an iron fist. Terrorizing both teachers and students alike with her unorthodox discipline techniques, often incorporating both pain and humiliation.\n\nMrs. [saga.cast.ursula.clan] carries an air of importance everywhere she goes and is constantly berating those around her over their numerous shortcomings.\n\nShe has recently started cutting the budget for all school programs and initiatives with no indication of where those funds are being redistributed."
    new "作为校长，她用铁腕统治学校。她那些不同寻常的管教手段常伴随着痛苦和羞辱，让师生都胆战心惊。\n\n[saga.cast.ursula.clan]夫人走到哪儿都摆出一副高高在上的架子，不停数落身边人的种种缺点。\n\n最近，她开始削减学校所有项目和活动的预算，却完全没说明省下的钱去了哪里。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:778
    old "The more soft-spoken of the Latina duo, [saga.cast.val] is never far from her other half. Though she's less antagonistic than [saga.cast.camila], she's no less cruel with her words."
    new "在那对拉丁裔搭档中，[saga.cast.val]说话声音更轻，却也从不离她的好搭档太远。她虽不像[saga.cast.camila]那样处处找茬，嘴上刻薄起来却一点也不输。"

    # game/res/meta/cast.rpym:783
    old "Miss [saga.cast.viv.clan] is a charming French beauty with a truly... {i}unique{/i} love for education. She seems wholly invested in furthering the academic pursuits of her students, by whatever means necessary. A connoisseur of fine wines and aged cheeses, a lover of poetry, and European history buff.\n\nHer office is like a gateway into her homeland."
    new "[saga.cast.viv.clan]小姐是位迷人的法国美人，对教育的热爱着实……{i}别具一格{/i}。为了帮学生进步，她似乎什么办法都愿意试。她懂美酒，爱陈年奶酪，喜欢诗歌，对欧洲历史也如数家珍。\n\n走进她的办公室，就像踏进了她的故乡。"
